# Browsable HTML renderings of ROADMAP.md, AUDIT.md and PLAYTEST.md, for reading
# in a browser rather than in a diff. Presentation only: every fact in them is in
# the tracked Markdown, so a deleted .reports/ costs nothing and project-manager
# can rebuild all three.
.reports/

# Superseded editable sources, kept out of the tree rather than deleted. The two
# tool textures were redrawn as DronePoser.svg and DroneSetter.svg, which are
# tracked; the GIMP files they replaced are stashed here.
textures/.old/

# Gameplay video, 79 MB. Git stores every byte of it in every clone forever, and
# nothing in a release or on the ContentDB page reads it from here: ContentDB's
# video field takes a URL to a host, not an upload. Keep the file beside the
# screenshots it was captured with, and out of the history.
screenshots/*.mp4
